{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30367","headline":"陪韦中丞宴扈都头花园 · 赵嘏","name":"陪韦中丞宴扈都头花园","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"门下烟横载酒船，谢家携客醉华筵。\n寻花偶坐将军树，饮水方重刺史天。\n几曲艳歌春色里，断行高鸟暮云边。\n分明听得舆人语，愿及行春更一年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30367.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30367","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}